OL,3,GNEWSATwo people charged over death of
OL,4,Aboy hit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo more people have been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with the death of a
OL,8,F12-year-old boy who was struck by a
OL,9,Fcar.
OL,11,FBobby Bloomfield was seriously hurt in
OL,12,FPilgrims Hatch, near Brentwood in
OL,13,FEssex, on 7 June and died in hospital
OL,14,Fhours later.
OL,16,FA 15-year-old boy, who cannot be named
OL,17,Ffor legal reasons, and 44-year-old
OL,18,FWilliam Lunnon, of Ashwells Road,
OL,19,FPilgrims Hatch, have been charged with
OL,20,Fhis murder.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
