OL,3,GNEWSATwo people charged over death of
OL,4,Aboy hit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FEssex Police said on Thursday that
OL,7,FWilliam Lunnon, 65, was charged with
OL,8,Fperverting the course of justice and
OL,9,FRuth Lunnon, 65, was charged with
OL,10,Fassisting an offender.
